    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy</a></i> </p><p>A Datadagger is an elaborate and decorative <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Code_Cylinder\" title=\"Code Cylinder\">Code Cylinder</a> that contains a hidden weapon. When the wielder twists the hilt, a needlelike blade extends from the socket. </p><p>Since the blade is so well hidden within the code's electronics, it is hard to detect (+5 bonus to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check to conceal the object, and no circumstance bonus if the examiner touches the wielder). </p>",
